full-query: "Your team is using AWS Elastic Beanstalk for web applications in a production environment. The project needs to read/write to a PostgreSQL RDS database in another production environment as well. Apart from this, the AWS Elastic Beanstalk also uses Immutable deployment and entirely new instances need to be created for new deployments. Among the options provided which one do you suggest to connect to RDS database for this Elastic Beanstalk environment?"
